  "description": "Min-Ung, the son who has long harbored a secret crush on the host, Jun-Ki, a single dad. It’s been a month since Min-Ung confessed his feelings to Jun-Ki, and in hopes of getting an answer from Jun-Ki, who continues to ignore him, Min-Ung goes to the host bar where he works.\n\n *“No way, you son of a bitch! I promised Chairman Park I’d give him my virginity!”*\n\nBut Min-Ung, losing his composure at those words, ends up doing something he can never take back... \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
